ers taught  you about the power of your own voice  when you share your story when you wear  your heart on your sleeves when you're  it connects with people and it connects  with people in different ways like I've  gotten just as many messages from  Christian parents and girls who don't  look like me but maybe live in rural  Wisconsin or like small towns in America  who are like wait you didn't have to  move to New York in order to have a  career in fashion like that's so cool  like I didn't I didn't know that a girl  from a small town could go and do these  things and she relates to me in that  from that lens right and then I also  have the young some girls who are like  wow you're wearing a hijab and I I  wasn't maybe confident in it before but  I see you you know rocking it on the  cover of British Vogue and I'm like oh  I'll wear it proudly and like so many  different messages from different people  and so I think that's what happens when  you give your heart and soul and like  you're open like I've been very open and  honest about my journey and like the  good the bad the the happy the  everything sitting here today what do  you feel like is the most pressing issue  for you I look back at my years behind  the camp and that's you know that was  when I was seven I'm 22 now and I'm just  like how is it possible that today  we have more people in poverty than when  I was in the camp like to me that is  just devastating and then you look at  statistics like every two seconds a  person is displaced from their home due  to war due to famine due to poverty and  I have a very hard time digesting that  because I look at the world that I'm  surrounded by and there's so much wealth  there's so much glamour surrounding life  and that I'm just like what can we be  doing you know what can we be doing so  people don't have to live that way and I  think that's what's such an important  symbol of together band is that showing  that we should all see the similarities  we have in each other and that's the  goal 2030 that's the big you and gold  says 17 sustainable development goals so  hopefully 2030 will have zero zero  hunger zero poverty zero I mean those  are ambitious that's very ambitious but  I think that should be what every human  is like striving to to make happen let's  make it happen 2030 nothing's impossible  I mean and in honey you are a symbol of  much love that  [Music]

